<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Couples Therapy | Dongming Zhao, LCSW</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Couples therapy grounded in Emotionally Focused Therapy (EFT), helping partners rebuild emotional connection — online throughout California." />
  <Seo title="Couples Therapy | Dongming Zhao, LCSW" description="Couples therapy grounded in Emotionally Focused Therapy (EFT), helping partners rebuild emotional connection—online throughout California." path="/couples-therapy/" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body class="page-couples">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

  <header class="site-header site-header--inset">
    <div class="wrap site-header__inner">
      <a class="brand" href="/">Dongming Zhao</a>

      <nav class="nav" data-open="false" aria-label="Primary">
        <ul class="nav__links">
          <li><a href="/about/">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/individual-therapy/">Individual Therapy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/couples-therapy/" aria-current="page">Couples Therapy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/zh/">&#20013;&#25991;&#24515;&#29702;</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq/">FAQ</a></li>
          <li class="nav__action"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--pill" href="/contact/">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
        <button class="nav__toggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="nav__toggle-icon"></span>
        </button>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">

    <!-- 1 — “Sound familiar?” -->
    <section class="section it-spread it-spread--quotes">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="reveal it-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Sound familiar?</span>
          <h2 class="h-lg section-heading">Maybe you&rsquo;ve been asking yourselves&hellip;</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="quote-grid reveal">
          <p class="quote">&ldquo;Why do we keep having the same fight?&rdquo;</p>
          <p class="quote">&ldquo;I don&rsquo;t feel like my partner really understands me.&rdquo;</p>
          <p class="quote">&ldquo;We love each other, but we don&rsquo;t feel close anymore.&rdquo;</p>
          <p class="quote">&ldquo;I don&rsquo;t know if I can trust my partner again.&rdquo;</p>
          <p class="quote">&ldquo;Sometimes I wonder if we&rsquo;re still right for each other.&rdquo;</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2 — Relationship patterns -->
    <section class="section section--band it-spread it-spread--fit">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="reveal it-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Relationship patterns</span>
          <h2 class="h-lg">Caught in the same painful cycle</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal prose prose--centered">
          <p class="lede lede--wide ink">You may love each other and still have the same argument every time. One of you pushes for more &mdash; more talking, more reassurance &mdash; while the other goes quiet or gets defensive. The harder one of you tries to be heard, the more criticized the other feels, and you both end up alone in it.</p>
          <p class="lede lede--wide">Or maybe you don&rsquo;t fight much at all. You manage work and family well enough, but the closeness has thinned out. Conversations stay practical, and affection isn&rsquo;t what it was.</p>
          <p class="lede lede--wide">Sometimes there&rsquo;s a deeper injury underneath: a betrayal, broken trust, resentment that built up over years. The care may still be there, even as you wonder how you got here and whether this can work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3 — “What working together is like” -->
    <section class="section it-spread it-spread--prose">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="reveal it-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Working together</span>
          <h2 class="h-lg">What working together is like</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal prose prose--centered">
          <p class="lede lede--wide ink">In our sessions, we&rsquo;ll slow down the conversations that keep ending in frustration and look beneath the anger, criticism, withdrawal, or silence. I&rsquo;ll help each of you express what&rsquo;s difficult to put into words and better understand what your partner is experiencing.</p>
          <p class="lede lede--wide">We&rsquo;ll also make room for concerns such as emotional distance, broken trust, or the feeling that you&rsquo;ve become more like roommates than partners. Together, we&rsquo;ll explore what has made it difficult to reach each other and find new ways to respond.</p>
          <p class="lede lede--wide">My work is grounded in Emotionally Focused Therapy (EFT), while also drawing from IFS, ACT, and CBT when helpful to your relationship.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Closing CTA — the shared component; identical on every page -->
    <section class="section--ink cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="cta__title">If this feels like the right place to begin, I&rsquo;d love to hear from you.</h2>
        <div class="cta__actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://therapywithdongming.sessionshealth.com/request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Free 15-Minute Consultation</a>
        </div>
        <p class="cta__email"><a href="mailto:therapywithdongming@gmail.com">therapywithdongming@gmail.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap site-footer__inner">
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> Dongming Zhao, LCSW</p>
      <ul class="site-footer__links">
        <li><a href="/about/">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/individual-therapy/">Individual Therapy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/couples-therapy/">Couples Therapy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/zh/">&#20013;&#25991;&#24515;&#29702;</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq/">FAQ</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="site-footer__note">Website information is educational and is not emergency care.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script is:inline src="/main.js"></script>
  <script>document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();</script>
</body>
</html>
